        <body>
            <div xml:id="d440">

                <pb facs="0756" n="1714" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1714"/>

                <head>No. 17.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Phelps to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-01-16"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 16, 1889</date>.
                        (Received January 23.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 901.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to previous correspondence
                    on the subject of Lord Sackville’s dismissal, and particularly to my dispatch
                    numbered 893, of 12th instant, I have the honor to inclose leading articles from
                    the Times and Daily News newspapers, respecting the correspondence published by
                    Her Majesty’s Government, copies of which have been forwarded to you.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. J. Phelps</hi>.</signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d440-a1.xml" xpointer="d440-a1"/>
